# tof_silent_est_high_noise.expect — the hover-thrust estimate 35 % too high (noise n2): the altitude ceiling is effective
# ホバー推力の見積もりが（ノイズ n2 で）35 % 高い: 高度の天井が実効的
#
# The auto-takeoff overshoot stays within the ceiling + margin (1.35 m) + the stopping distance (peak 1.2-1.5 m, before: 1.69 m); the descent without a ToF
# ends on the floor, not by the time limit or an emergency DISARM.
# 自動離陸の行き過ぎは、天井 + 余裕（1.35 m）+ 停止距離に収まり（最高 1.2〜1.5 m、以前: 1.69 m）、ToF なしの降下は床の上で終わる（時間切れ・非常の DISARM ではない）。
exit 0
log_contains any "Takeoff complete → FLYING/ALT_HOLD"
log_contains any "Blind landing: ToF silent, velocity loop"
log_contains any "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND"
log_contains any "ARM rejected: downward ToF is silent"
log_absent any "touchdown by time"
log_absent any "emergency DISARM"
order "Blind landing: ToF silent" "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND"
order "Transition: LANDING → IDLE_GROUND" "ARM rejected: downward ToF is silent"
metric alt_max < 1.55 in 7.0 28.0
metric alt_max < 0.05 in 22.0 28.0
